      "source": "Adds new fields to documents. <code>$set</code> outputs documents that contain all existing fields from the input\ndocuments and newly added fields.\n\n<pre class=\"code\">SetOperation.set(\"totalHomework\").toValue(\"A+\").and().set(\"totalQuiz\").toValue(\"B-\")\n</pre>",
      "translation": "向文档添加新字段。<code>$set</code> 输出包含输入文档中所有现有字段以及新增字段的文档。\n\n<pre class=\"code\">SetOperation.set(\"totalHomework\").toValue(\"A+\").and().set(\"totalQuiz\").toValue(\"B-\")\n</pre>",
      "count": 1
    },
